@startuml
' Deployment-01 — BrewLite: Production, CI/CD và Local (Task 3.2)
' Nguồn: docs/architecture/architecture.md, docs/deployment.md, ADR-006
' Kết xuất: docs/diagrams/deployment.svg
' Lưu ý: production chưa được tạo; sơ đồ là kế hoạch triển khai đã chốt.
title Deployment-01 — BrewLite: Production, CI/CD và Local

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}

actor "Khách hàng\n(Customer)" as Customer

node "User Device\n(Browser / PWA)" as Device {
  artifact "PWA Shell\nmanifest · service worker · app shell\ncart state (localStorage)" as PwaShell
}

rectangle "PRODUCTION" as Prod #F7F9FF {
  node "Render Web Service\n(Next.js Web)" as RenderWeb {
    artifact "Next.js Web (PWA)\nDocker image từ GHCR\nHTTPS 443 · container 3000\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL" as Web
  }

  node "Render Web Service\n(NestJS API Container)" as RenderApi {
    artifact "NestJS API\nDocker image từ GHCR\ncontainer port 3000" as Api
    component "Mock Payment Gateway\n(in-process adapter)" as MockPay
    component "Health endpoints\nGET /health\nGET /health/ready" as Health

    Api --> MockPay : PaymentGateway port\n(createPayment / verifyResult)
    Api --> Health : liveness / readiness
  }

  node "Render Managed PostgreSQL\n(Persistent storage)" as ManagedDb {
    database "PostgreSQL Database\nschema public\ninternal URL + SSL" as Db
  }
}

rectangle "CI / CD — GitHub Actions" as CICD #FFF8F0 {
  node "GitHub Actions\n(CI/CD)" as Actions {
    artifact "ci.yml / cd.yml\nInstall → Lint → Test → Build\nDocker build + push + smoke test" as Pipeline
  }

  node "GitHub Container Registry\n(GHCR)" as Registry {
    artifact "ghcr.io/<owner>/<repo>/web\nghcr.io/<owner>/<repo>/api\n:sha-<commit> · :semver · :latest" as Image
  }
}

rectangle "LOCAL — Developer Machine" as Local #F2FBF4 {
  node "Docker Compose" as Compose {
    artifact "web (Next.js)\napi (NestJS)\ndb (PostgreSQL)\nvolume: pgdata" as ComposeArtifact
  }
}

' ===== Luồng production =====
Customer --> Device : sử dụng
Device --> RenderWeb : HTTPS 443
Device --> RenderApi : HTTPS 443\nREST/JSON + JWT
Web --> RenderApi : HTTPS\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
Api --> Db : PostgreSQL 5432\ninternal URL + SSL

' ===== Luồng CI/CD =====
Local ..> Actions : git push / pull request
Actions --> Registry : push web/API images (HTTPS)
Registry --> RenderWeb : pull web image (HTTPS)
Registry --> RenderApi : pull API image (HTTPS)
Actions ..> RenderWeb : deploy hook / Render API
Actions ..> RenderApi : deploy hook / Render API
Actions ..> RenderApi : smoke test GET /health

' ===== Ghi chú bảo mật / vận hành =====
note right of RenderApi
  **Secret / environment**
  DATABASE_URL · JWT_SECRET · CORS_ORIGIN
  PAYMENT_PROVIDER · RUN_MIGRATIONS
  Không public DB; chỉ internal URL + SSL.
  Log JSON → Render Logs.
end note

note right of RenderWeb
  **Web environment**
  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL (inline lúc build)
  HTTPS + static asset/cache theo Render.
  Không chứa secret trong bundle.
end note

note bottom of Local
  Local dùng HTTP và .env riêng.
  Không dùng chung DB/secret với production.
end note

note bottom of CICD
  Quality gate: PR fail lint/test/build → chặn merge.
  CD: image tag SHA/semver → GHCR → Render → migrate → smoke test.
  Rollback: image tag cũ + DB restore backup.
end note

legend right
  **Giao thức / cổng**
  - Public: HTTPS 443 (Render Web, Render API)
  - Container web/API: HTTP 3000 (Render inject PORT)
  - PostgreSQL: 5432, chỉ private network + SSL
  - Gateway mock: không mở cổng (in-process)

  **Ranh giới môi trường**
  - Local: Docker Compose web + api + db
  - CI: GitHub Actions + GHCR
  - Production: Render Web + Render API + Render Postgres

  **Bảo mật / vận hành**
  - Secrets: Render Environment + GitHub Secrets
  - Health: /health, /health/ready
  - Log: JSON stdout → Render Logs

  **Trạng thái**
  - Production: KẾ HOẠCH (chưa tạo hạ tầng)
  - CI/CD: thiết kế (Task 4.4 / 5.3)
  - Local: Docker Compose (Task 4.1)
endlegend

@enduml
